Package: nabla-edge
Version: 0.8.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: whiptail, coreutils
Recommends: docker.io | docker-ce
Maintainer: Nabla <packages@nabla.net>
Description: NablaEdge system configuration and imaging tools
 NablaEdge provides tools for configuring Raspberry Pi edge nodes:
  - nabla-config: Interactive whiptail menu for system setup
  - nabla-image: SD/USB imaging tool for new nodes
 .
 After installation, run: sudo nabla-config
